{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart of Mycelium is cozy autumn adventure with mysteries and horrors waiting beneath the surface! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751860/extras/53736163cef8dafe63ac23040fee0d2d.avif?t=1772235709\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751860/extras_big/53736163cef8dafe63ac23040fee0d2d.avif?t=1772235709 width=800 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful pixel art environments!</strong>\u00a0Journey through a hand-crafted world illustrated in vibrant pixel graphics.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A seamless blend of combat and platforming!\u00a0</strong>Navigate precise platforming or engaging enemy encounters  with a versatile dash attack and tight controls.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet all sorts of fungal characters.</strong> Every mushroom has something interesting to say, if you listen closely enough.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ atmospheric areas to traverse!</strong> Explore a captivating world with everything from a pinecone city to a deep sea reef of morel mushrooms. You are sure to find something new at every corner, some things less pleasant than others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ unique enemies and 5 mighty bosses!</strong>\u00a0No two creatures are the same, each requiring a unique approach to defeat. Battle a seahorsefly firing a barrage of babies or bounce on the limbs of a spidercrab to reach  up high!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain the powers of different mushrooms.</strong> Pick up mushrooms on your journey and attune with their unique abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horrors below.</strong> On your journey you will encounter animals, plants, mushrooms and... something else entirely.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751860?t=1772235709","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751860/7e78adebf63bf52f083f567ee2660489f29bd021/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772235709","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751860/fc4a54aafef4b9e3c5eea6a62e84024c14ff78d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772235709","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751860/fc4a54aafef4b9e3c5eea6a62e84024c14ff78d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772235709","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart of Mycelium is cozy autumn adventure with mysteries and horrors waiting beneath the surface! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751860/extras/53736163cef8dafe63ac23040fee0d2d.avif?t=1772235709\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751860/extras_big/53736163cef8dafe63ac23040fee0d2d.avif?t=1772235709 width=800 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful pixel art environments!</strong>\u00a0Journey through a hand-crafted world illustrated in vibrant pixel graphics.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A seamless blend of combat and platforming!\u00a0</strong>Navigate precise platforming or engaging enemy encounters  with a versatile dash attack and tight controls.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet all sorts of fungal characters.</strong> Every mushroom has something interesting to say, if you listen closely enough.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ atmospheric areas to traverse!</strong> Explore a captivating world with everything from a pinecone city to a deep sea reef of morel mushrooms. You are sure to find something new at every corner, some things less pleasant than others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ unique enemies and 5 mighty bosses!</strong>\u00a0No two creatures are the same, each requiring a unique approach to defeat. Battle a seahorsefly firing a barrage of babies or bounce on the limbs of a spidercrab to reach  up high!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain the powers of different mushrooms.</strong> Pick up mushrooms on your journey and attune with their unique abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horrors below.</strong> On your journey you will encounter animals, plants, mushrooms and... something else entirely.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Melvin Bentinger"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751860/0d44c99fd7acaf79a13133c42cb6083761c109ee/header.jpg?t=1772235709","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Heart of Mycelium","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 10-compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1000 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Melvin Bentinger"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa",